OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS envoys head to meet Zelensky after
OL,4,Atalks with Putin in Moscow
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier on Thursday Zelensky said
OL,7,FUkraine's military was again facing
OL,8,F"systematic" restrictions to Starlink's
OL,9,Fmilitary-grade satellite service,
OL,10,FStarshield, meaning Kyiv was struggling
OL,11,Fto intercept Russian jet-powered
OL,12,Fdrones.
OL,14,FThe talks in the Emirates were framed
OL,15,Fas being centred around European
OL,16,Fsecurity arrangements in a post-war
OL,17,Fscenario, although a resolution to the
OL,18,Fwar sparked by Russia's full-scale
OL,19,Finvasion of Ukraine in 2022 still
OL,20,Fappears distant.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
